flowchart TB
    USER["Owner (Voice / Desktop GUI)"] --> ORCH["TurnOrchestrator & Bounded Tool Planner"]
    ORCH --> GATE["AuthorizedActionGateway\n(Single Authoritative Chokepoint)"]

    subgraph POLICY["Trusted Python/Rust Security Kernel"]
